00:00:34.335 --> 00:00:38.539 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Dr JASMIN VILLENEUVE, médecin-

00:00:35.836 --> 00:00:40.074 size:53% position:73% line:53%
conseil, INSPQ

00:00:37.371 --> 00:00:41.608 size:53% position:73% line:53%
