00:00:58.726 --> 00:01:02.963 size:53% position:73% line:53%
au Québec, où on a eu quelques

00:01:00.427 --> 00:01:04.498 size:53% position:73% line:53%
rieurement, dans

00:01:01.762 --> 00:01:07.568 size:53% position:73% line:53%
