00:01:35.796 --> 00:01:39.533 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ou qui va causer des infecti

00:01:36.697 --> 00:01:41.535 size:53% position:73% line:53%
surtout chez les patients qui

00:01:37.865 --> 00:01:43.637 size:53% position:73% line:53%
