00:03:13.427 --> 00:03:19.166 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Je pose la question.

00:03:15.429 --> 00:03:20.701 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- En fait, ça fait partie

00:03:17.464 --> 00:03:21.902 size:53% position:73% line:53%
