00:03:25.739 --> 00:03:28.509 size:53% position:73% line:53%
par contact, contact direct,

00:03:26.773 --> 00:03:29.510 size:53% position:73% line:53%
peau à peau avec une personne,

00:03:27.808 --> 00:03:30.544 size:53% position:73% line:53%
contact indirect avec

00:03:28.842 --> 00:03:31.578 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'environnement, les appareils

00:03:29.843 --> 00:03:32.613 size:53% position:73% line:53%
utilisés; et il peut rester

00:03:30.878 --> 00:03:33.647 size:53% position:73% line:53%
effectivement dans

00:03:31.912 --> 00:03:34.681 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'environnement si on effectue

00:03:32.946 --> 00:03:35.716 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pas de désinfection. Quand on

00:03:33.981 --> 00:03:36.717 size:53% position:73% line:53%
effectue unr désinfection

00:03:35.015 --> 00:03:37.751 size:53% position:73% line:53%
régulière et adéquate, on peut

00:03:36.049 --> 00:03:38.785 size:53% position:73% line:53%
