00:04:00.207 --> 00:04:04.144 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il peut donner des infections

00:04:01.742 --> 00:04:05.379 size:53% position:73% line:53%
invasives chez les personnes

00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:06.613 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à risque : je parlais tantôt

00:04:04.478 --> 00:04:07.814 size:53% position:73% line:53%
