00:04:09.416 --> 00:04:12.753 size:53% position:73% line:53%
au décès, mais c'est des gens

00:04:10.651 --> 00:04:14.288 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui ont déjà beaucoup

00:04:11.885 --> 00:04:15.822 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de pathologies qui vont être

00:04:13.087 --> 00:04:17.357 size:53% position:73% line:53%
beaucoup plus fragiles pour

00:04:14.621 --> 00:04:18.892 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les infections. Et aussi...

00:04:16.156 --> 00:04:20.427 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Et quand vous dites invasive,

00:04:17.691 --> 00:04:21.628 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vous voulez dire que c'est

00:04:19.226 --> 00:04:22.663 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tout le corps. C'est systémique

00:04:20.761 --> 00:04:23.697 size:53% position:73% line:53%
