00:04:21.962 --> 00:04:24.731 size:53% position:73% line:53%
par exemple.

00:04:22.996 --> 00:04:25.766 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Exactement, quand on parle

00:04:24.031 --> 00:04:26.800 size:53% position:73% line:53%
