00:04:26.099 --> 00:04:29.036 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dans le sang, il va se promener

00:04:27.134 --> 00:04:31.071 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dans le sang, qui va donner

00:04:28.135 --> 00:04:33.107 size:53% position:73% line:53%
