00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:53.360 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ce qui fait que ça augmente

00:04:51.225 --> 00:04:54.561 size:53% position:73% line:53%
encore la possible probabilité

00:04:52.459 --> 00:04:55.796 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ou la possibilité de donner des

00:04:53.694 --> 00:04:57.030 size:53% position:73% line:53%
