00:05:02.269 --> 00:05:05.606 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Mais j'ai lu quelque part que

00:05:03.504 --> 00:05:06.840 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le risque d'en mourir de cette

00:05:04.738 --> 00:05:08.075 size:53% position:73% line:53%
